msgid ""
"Did you find this software useful?\n"
"\n"
"You can buy me a coffee or make a donation via PayPal to show your support. "
"Or just drop me an email and say Hi. This application is completely free and "
"will continue to remain that way. Your contributions will help in keeping "
"this project alive and improving it further.\n"
"\n"
"Feel free to send me an email if you find any issues in this application or "
"if you need any changes. Suggestions and feedback are always welcome.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"Tony George\n"
"(teejeetech@gmail.com)\n"
"\n"
"Bionic to Focal to Jammy support, 1.10+ config support, magic archive "
"import, terminal debug function, and more\n"
"-help finance the efforts with these buttons to the right.\n"
"                                                                                          Scott "
"Caudle\n"
"                                                                                (zcotcaudle@gmail.com)"
msgstr ""
"你觉得这个软件有用吗？\n"
"\n"
"你可以通过 PayPal 请我喝杯咖啡或捐赠，以表达支持；也可以给我发一封邮件打个招呼。"
"这个应用完全免费，并会继续保持免费。你的贡献将帮助这个项目持续维护并进一步改进。\n"
"\n"
"如果你在此应用中发现问题，或需要任何改动，欢迎随时给我发送邮件。建议和反馈始终欢迎。\n"
"\n"
"谢谢，\n"
"Tony George\n"
"(teejeetech@gmail.com)\n"
"\n"
"从 Bionic 到 Focal 再到 Jammy 的支持、1.10+ 配置支持、灵活的归档导入、终端调试功能等。\n"
"请使用右侧这些按钮帮助资助相关工作。\n"
"Scott Caudle\n"
"(zcotcaudle@gmail.com)"

