"Window Opacity\n"
"\n"
"0 = Fully Transparent, 100 = Fully Opaque"
msgstr ""
"窗口不透明度\n"
"\n"
"0 = 完全透明，100 = 完全不透明"

msgid "Opacity (%)"
msgstr "不透明度（%）"

msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "背景颜色"

msgid ""
"Setting Type to \"Transparent\" will make the whole window transparent "
"(including any images). Use \"Pseudo-Transparent\" if you want the images to "
"be opaque."
msgstr ""
"将类型设为“Transparent”会使整个窗口透明（包括所有图片）。如果希望图片保持不透明，"
"请使用“Pseudo-Transparent”。"

msgid ""
"Setting Type to \"Pseudo-Transparent\" will make the window transparent but "
"the window will have a shadow. The shadow can be disabled by configuring "
"your window manager."
msgstr ""
"将类型设为“Pseudo-Transparent”会使窗口透明，但窗口仍会有阴影。可以通过配置窗口管理器"
"禁用阴影。"

